# Fixture: stretched N2 (2.2 A), UHF with a broken-symmetry guess and the
# molecule divided into two fragments (fragment index syntax N(1) / N(2)) so
# that ORCA prints the local spin analysis.
! UHF def2-SVP TightSCF
%scf brokensym 3,3 end
%pal nprocs 2 end
%maxcore 2000
* xyz 0 1
N(1) 0 0 0
N(2) 0 0 2.2
*
